      "name": "bestseller-widget",
      "type": "mini_coding",
      "title": "Build the bestseller list the mobile app can read",
      "description": "The \"Bán chạy\" widget of the Hồ Gươm Books app shows the best-selling books that are in stock. The old code sent the app a JSON object instead of an array, filled the list with fewer books than asked, and swapped books with equal sales on every refresh. Write bestsellers: keep the books in stock, sort them by sales with a tie-break on id, take the first N and number them, and return a real list. The test runner decodes the request from JSON and prints your result as JSON.",
